-gray">7</span>\n <p class="bookname">隋末夺鹿</p>\n <p class="author">牛角的二师兄</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/783.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">8</span>\n <p class="bookname">重生之我想收房租</p>\n <p class="author">山水是名</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/127246.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">9</span>\n <p class="bookname">来吧狼性总裁</p>\n <p class="author">萌爷</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/835.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">10</span>\n <p class="bookname">这个诡异有亿点好吃</p>\n <p class="author">叁号机器人</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1302.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">11</span>\n <p class="bookname">致璀璨的他</p>\n <p class="author">米西亚</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1328.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">12</span>\n <p class="bookname">重生之文豪崛起</p>\n <p class="author">汪公子在年</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1280.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">13</span>\n <p class="bookname">在斗罗大陆不讲武德</p>\n <p class="author">笔名不许空</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/565.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">14</span>\n <p class="bookname">精灵之沙暴君王</p>\n <p class="author">小猪题字</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1361.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">15</span>\n <p class="bookname">诸天：从叶问开始的强化之旅</p>\n <p class="author">星空夜竹</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n</div>\n<form action="/search.html" method="post" class="search">\n\t\t<span><i class="layui-icon i_search"></i><i class="layui-icon i_cancel"></i><input type="text" name="searchkey" placeholder="请输入搜索内容！" /></span>\n\t\t<button class="layui-btn">搜索</button>\n\t</form>\n<div class="footer">\n<p><a href="/shuku/">书库</a> <a href="/sort.html">分类</a> <a href="/zuozhe/">作者</a> <a href="/wanben/">全本</a> <a href="/top/">排